---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import desktop from '../assets/desktop.png';
import mini from '../assets/mini.png';
---
<Page title="Screenshots — Pudding" description="Take a look at Pudding Desktop: your music library, album artwork, playback controls, and a compact mini player.">
  <header class="page-heading"><h1>Screenshots</h1><p class="intro">A little oldschool. Plenty of room for the music.</p></header>
  <div class="gallery">
    <article>
      <h2>The full collection</h2><p>Your files, library, and playback controls together, with the cover art front and center.</p>
      <figure class="app-preview"><Image src={desktop} alt="Pudding Desktop’s dark interface with a folder browser, music library, album cover, equalizer, and playback controls." widths={[640, 1200, 1956]} sizes="(max-width: 1184px) 94vw, 1120px" format="webp" loading="eager" /><figcaption>Pudding Desktop / Library view</figcaption></figure>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h2>A smaller footprint</h2><p>Double-click the album art to switch to the mini player. Double-click again to return to your library.</p>
      <figure class="app-preview mini-preview"><Image src={mini} alt="Pudding’s compact mini player showing album artwork and playback controls." format="webp" /><figcaption>Pudding Desktop / Mini player</figcaption></figure>
    </article>
  </div>
</Page>
